metrics, logging, and rate limiting.

Key Drizzle translations:
- prisma.attempt.findUnique({deep include}) → loadAttemptContext() with 4
  scoped SELECTs (attempts, questionResponses, quizQuestions for points,
  questionStandards) + 1 SELECT for the existing masteryRun.
