  (studentId, standardId) constraint.
- Prisma error codes: P2002 → pg 23505 (unique violation); P2034 → pg
  40001 (serialization_failure). Both branches preserved with the exact
  same response shapes/status codes/retry-after headers.
- MasteryRunStatus enum: now from @/lib/enums (added in same commit).
- masteryLevel passed to .values()/.set() as String(...) (decimal(3,2)).

